/-- ★★ THE WRAP COUNT IS `9`. FALLS OUT of the comark vector `(1,2,3,2,1)`: `1+2+3+2+1 = 9`. This is
    the dual Coxeter number of F₄ — the number of constituents a full self-wrap of the arena's forced
    symmetry splits into. Never premised as a literal `9`. -/
theorem comarkCount_eq_nine : comarkCount = 9 := by
  simp [comarkCount, comarkVec, Fin.sum_univ_five]

/-! ## (4) THE WELD — the derived comark count IS the banked `finrank spaceSub`. -/

